"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 33 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 46% of normal in July to August and 38% of normal in August to September. Each grid had its driest year in 2001, with grid 29332 down at 70% that year.</p>"}
